message:
The daily 07:00 UTC Core Sync scheduler found the sync lock held on every attempt, including its same-day retries (`core-sync.scheduled.retry`, 15 minutes apart, up to 3 times), and gave up. No Core Sync run happened today.

This almost always means a prior run is still holding the lock past its 15-minute stale window (an unusually long-running sync, or a worker that died without releasing the lock). Check `/dashboard/workflows` for the currently-held `core-sync` lock and whichever run is holding it, and consider a manual `core-sync:run` once the stuck run is resolved.

